{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURN\u2011BASED TACTICS MEETS ACTION RPG LOOTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stolen Realm is a fast-paced tactical dungeon crawler where explosive builds, meaningful loot, and simultaneous turn-based combat collide. Lead a party of up to six heroes through dangerous expeditions filled with monsters, treasure, and unpredictable events. Play solo or team up with friends in seamless online co\u2011op as you explore a vibrant, readable low\u2011poly fantasy world. Every dive into the Realm offers new challenges, new loot, and new ways to break the game in your favour.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/c768c150ac016a1c38a639c3547ceecc.poster.avif?t=1772834209\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/c768c150ac016a1c38a639c3547ceecc.webm?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/c768c150ac016a1c38a639c3547ceecc.mp4?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FAST, SIMULTANEOUS TURN\u2011BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Both sides act at the same time, keeping battles quick without losing tactical depth. Plan your moves, unleash your abilities, and watch the entire battlefield react at once. No waiting for long enemy turns. No downtime. Just tight, high\u2011impact encounters where positioning and synergy matter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/5745abfcc66f0790296f5336f5ceaa54.poster.avif?t=1772834209\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/5745abfcc66f0790296f5336f5ceaa54.webm?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/5745abfcc66f0790296f5336f5ceaa54.mp4?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD ANY HERO YOU CAN IMAGINE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no fixed classes. Choose from 300+ abilities across 10 flexible skill trees and craft a hero that fits your playstyle. Create classic archetypes or experiment with hybrids like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A spell\u2011slinging assassin</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A frost\u2011born priest</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A shadow\u2011infused knight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or something completely unhinged that shouldn\u2019t work but absolutely does</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/f596cd9347e7d7dd634efd09f7ff8714.poster.avif?t=1772834209\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/f596cd9347e7d7dd634efd09f7ff8714.webm?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/f596cd9347e7d7dd634efd09f7ff8714.mp4?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LOOT THAT TRANSFORMS YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover 700+ items that do far more than raise your stats. Mythic weapons and relics unlock new mechanics, new synergies, and new strategies. Wield artifacts like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abbadon the Soul Crusher - raise slain enemies as skeletal allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bloodletter - a cursed blade that trades your lifeblood for devastating power</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition opens the door to new combinations and new build possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/c87ec20fae27363462a9fa29c169b560.poster.avif?t=1772834209\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/c87ec20fae27363462a9fa29c169b560.webm?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/c87ec20fae27363462a9fa29c169b560.mp4?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR PATH THROUGH THE REALM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each adventure unfolds across a procedurally generated map where every decision shapes your run. After every battle you choose your next step, whether that\u2019s diving into a treasure room, chasing a story event, visiting a merchant, gathering resources, or risking a dangerous encounter. Every expedition becomes its own story, defined by the choices you make and the luck you carry with you into the Realm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/e2237203f1de81c1f6f4ac09f22a1d77.poster.avif?t=1772834209\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/e2237203f1de81c1f6f4ac09f22a1d77.webm?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/e2237203f1de81c1f6f4ac09f22a1d77.mp4?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE CO\u2011OP FOR UP TO 6 PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or bring friends. Stolen Realm is built for co\u2011op strategy, with encounters that scale automatically and a drop\u2011in/drop\u2011out system that keeps the action flowing. Coordinate builds, chain abilities, and unleash devastating team combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/a1f631018bc5700a454ef432f02ccae6.poster.avif?t=1772834209\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/a1f631018bc5700a454ef432f02ccae6.webm?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/a1f631018bc5700a454ef432f02ccae6.mp4?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT PLAYERS &amp; PRESS ARE SAYING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cThe tactical depth of Divinity: Original Sin.\u201d \u2014 <strong>GamesRadar+</strong><br>\u201cWe\u2019re losing our evenings to Stolen Realm.\u201d \u2014 <strong>TheXboxHub</strong><br>\u201cA gorgeous looking game.\u201d \u2014 <strong>PC Gamer</strong><br>\u201cYou can do all sorts of weird stuff.\u201d \u2014 <strong>Sacriel</strong><br>\u201cStraight to the point\u2026 no bullsh*t.\u201d \u2014 <i><strong>Shroud</strong></i><br>\u201cIt\u2019s rad.\u201d \u2014 <i><strong>Sequisha</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/37318f3bc2a7a1d59fd35e32088b660e.poster.avif?t=1772834209\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/37318f3bc2a7a1d59fd35e32088b660e.webm?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/37318f3bc2a7a1d59fd35e32088b660e.mp4?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online co\u2011op for up to 6 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast, simultaneous turn\u2011based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >300+ abilities across 10 skill trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >700+ lootable items that change how you play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical hex\u2011based battlefields with interactive environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ enemy types with unique modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural adventures with branching paths and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Campaign mode, Roguelike mode, and Hardcore permadeath</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"91e3cf8213f92aa487db9559b411cfbabac19074.jpg","localized_name":"Blood Mask Boss","name":"Blood Mask Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330000/91e3cf8213f92aa487db9559b411cfbabac19074.jpg"},{"icon":"91e3cf8213f92aa487db9559b411cfbabac19074.jpg","localized_name":"Blood Mask Boss - Hardcore","name":"Blood Mask Boss - Hardcore","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330000/91e3cf8213f92aa487db9559b411cfbabac19074.jpg"},{"icon":"91e3cf8213f92aa487db9559b411cfbabac19074.jpg","localized_name":"Blood Mask Boss - Heart of the Realm","name":"Blood Mask Boss - Heart of the Realm","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1330000/91e3cf8213f92aa487db9559b411cfbabac19074.jpg"},{"icon":"f6b877b6ddb2cc9ab577e358afbead307b27