ep, whether that\u2019s diving into a treasure room, chasing a story event, visiting a merchant, gathering resources, or risking a dangerous encounter. Every expedition becomes its own story, defined by the choices you make and the luck you carry with you into the Realm.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/e2237203f1de81c1f6f4ac09f22a1d77.poster.avif?t=1772834209\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/e2237203f1de81c1f6f4ac09f22a1d77.webm?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/e2237203f1de81c1f6f4ac09f22a1d77.mp4?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ONLINE CO\u2011OP FOR UP TO 6 PLAYERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or bring friends. Stolen Realm is built for co\u2011op strategy, with encounters that scale automatically and a drop\u2011in/drop\u2011out system that keeps the action flowing. Coordinate builds, chain abilities, and unleash devastating team combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/a1f631018bc5700a454ef432f02ccae6.poster.avif?t=1772834209\" width=616 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/a1f631018bc5700a454ef432f02ccae6.webm?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1330000/extras/a1f631018bc5700a454ef432f02ccae6.mp4?t=1772834209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHAT PLAYERS &amp; PRESS ARE SAYING</strong></h2><p